GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT


Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In spring, Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0)'s minions initiated a 
campaign of conquest directed at Florence, a Mountain province owing its 
allegiance to Riose (#52).  Babba Sissoko (#0) was in command of the 
invading armies.  The defenders were led by Riose (#52).  Florence was 
overrun by Babba Sissoko (#0)'s men in a hard-fought campaign.

  In late summer, a great host of warriors carried the banner of 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango into the Plain province of the Maldive Sea, 
held by Migfox (#65).  Babba Sissoko (#0) was in command of the invading 
armies.  The defenders were led by Migfox (#65).  Babba Sissoko (#0)'s 
well-planned campaign accomplished the conquest of the Maldive Sea.


